  "description": "The Cargo Hybrid 800 will change the way you think about two-wheeled transport. With a maximum system weight of 200kg, rear carrier and its versatile EPP foam cargo box, it's capable of carrying more than you think – and optional accessories like child seats with safety harnesses extend its versatility even further. It's easy to ride, too. Bosch's powerful Cargo Line motor and an 800Wh battery offer up to 100Nm of pedal assistance, while easy-to-use and wide-ranging Shimano Cues 9-speed gears put the right ratio at your fingertips. Bright LED lights front and rear ensure you can see and be seen, mudguards and grippy tyres make light work of wet streets, there's a super-stable kickstand for easy parking, and powerful Shimano hydraulic disc brakes ensure you're always in control, whatever the weather. Wherever you're going and whatever you need to take with you, it's got you covered.",
